<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18396" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀφλέγ-μαντος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>free from inflammation,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Acut.</u>
				46
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Fract.</u>
				31
			</span></i>; <i>not liable to it,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				863a15
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίδεσισ-οτάτη</span>”
				<i>least inflammatory,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					10.451
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>”
				<i>without causing inflammation,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aët.
					15.14
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>relieving</i> or <i>checking inflammation,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παντὸς τραύματος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>Od.</u>
					35
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Heliod.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				46.8.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.73
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> of food,
				<i>not heating,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τράπεζαι</span> Ion Lyr.in<i><span class="en">
				<u>PLG</u>
				2.257
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>without phlegm,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πύον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Coac.</u>
					396
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
